{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource\/setfeaturestateforfeatureid:state:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets the state of a feature in this source."}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:"}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNShapeSource(im)setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","text":"BOOL"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setFeatureStateForFeatureID:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"featureID"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"state:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSDictionary","text":"NSDictionary<NSString *,id>"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"state"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The identifier of the feature whose state to set."}]}],"name":"featureID"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A set of key-value pairs to merge into the feature’s state. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values should be valid JSON types."}]}],"name":"state"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YES"},{"type":"text","text":" if the source is attached to a map and the update was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dispatched."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateExample"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A feature’s state is a set of user-defined key-value pairs that are assigned"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to a feature at runtime. The state object is merged with any existing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key-value pairs in the feature’s state. Feature state can be read in style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"expressions through the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"feature-state"},{"type":"text","text":" expression operator."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The target feature must have an identifier in the underlying source data:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"id"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute in the original GeoJSON data, or an "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"identifier"},{"type":"text","text":" is set."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method can only be used while the source is attached to a map."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"type":"topic","title":"MapLibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource/setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource\/setfeaturestateforfeatureid:state:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets the state of a feature in this source."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:","kind":"symbol","title":"setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNVectorTileSource":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectortilesource","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies tiled vector data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in "},{"type":"text","text":"Mapbox Vector Tile"},{"type":"text","text":" format"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to be shown on the map. The location of and metadata about the tiles are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A vector tile source is added to an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object along with one or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" objects. A vector style layer defines the appearance of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any content supplied by the vector tile source."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","kind":"symbol","title":"MLNVectorTileSource","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNVectorTileSource","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is an abstract class that represents a shape or annotation. Shapes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constitute the content of a map — not only the overlays atop the map, but also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the content that forms the base map."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","kind":"symbol","title":"MLNShape","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShape","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The proxy object for the current map style."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","kind":"symbol","title":"MLNStyle","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNStyle","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/FeatureStateExample":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/featurestateexample","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This example demonstrates how to use feature state to create interactive maps with dynamic styling based on user interactions."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateExample","kind":"article","title":"Set Feature State","role":"article"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies vector shapes to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shown on the map. The shapes may be instances of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or they may be defined by local or external"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GeoJSON"},{"type":"text","text":" code. A shape source is added to an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object along with an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object. The vector style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layer defines the appearance of any content supplied by the shape source. You"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can update a shape source by setting its "},{"code":"shape","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"URL","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","kind":"symbol","title":"MLNShapeSource","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSource","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNFeature":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnfeature","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"  protocol is used to provide details about geographic features"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"contained in an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object. Each concrete"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"subclass of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in turn has a subclass that conforms to this protocol. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feature object associates a shape with an optional identifier and attributes."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","kind":"symbol","title":"MLNFeature","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNFeature","kind":"identifier"}]}}}